id: diehard
name: Diehard
talentCategory: threshold
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Your ability to shrug off injury is remarkable.
text: >
  Diehard: Your ability to shrug off injury is remarkable.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Life Points by 2 for each of your Power Levels.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.

---

[passive]
# (1) As Survival Training's: 2 for each Power Level.
life.perLevel += 2;
# (2)
steadfast.dice += 1;
